    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MINIMALIST COLORFUL LANDSCAPE BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.poster.avif?t=1752700129\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.webm?t=1752700129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.mp4?t=1752700129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Paint the terrain and place natural elements to <strong>grow a beautiful landscape tile by tile</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb8 Discover <strong>many biomes</strong> organized in <strong>three main climates</strong>: temperate, polar and tropical</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Never compose the same landscape twice with <strong>procedurally generated archipelagos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaf Leverage <strong>various intuitive placement rules</strong> to maximize your <strong>score</strong> and your <strong>strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Appreciate <strong>colorful 3D pixel art visuals</strong> with <strong>dynamic lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Enjoy a <strong>relaxing</strong> and <strong>peaceful experience</strong> that you can come back to once in a while</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Unleash <strong>your creativity</strong> and watch <strong>your tiny landscape</strong> slowly getting back to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/e172a227b9ec11688abd2ecc582d4f6e.avif?t=1752700129\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT RADIANT SLOTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiant Sloth (he/him) is a <strong>solo indie game developer</strong> from France, He has a passion for creating <strong>inspiring and entertaining art</strong>, and is committed to <strong>ethical and sustainable game development</strong>. In particular, he strives to maintain <strong>honest and transparent communication</strong> with the community, advocates <strong>awareness of carbon footprint</strong> and climate issues, and <strong>bans generative AI tools</strong> from his creation process.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MINIMALIST COLORFUL LANDSCAPE BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.poster.avif?t=1752700129\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.webm?t=1752700129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ebf101091325302eaa5f6ebc5288f5a7.mp4?t=1752700129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Paint the terrain and place natural elements to <strong>grow a beautiful landscape tile by tile</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb8 Discover <strong>many biomes</strong> organized in <strong>three main climates</strong>: temperate, polar and tropical</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Never compose the same landscape twice with <strong>procedurally generated archipelagos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaf Leverage <strong>various intuitive placement rules</strong> to maximize your <strong>score</strong> and your <strong>strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Appreciate <strong>colorful 3D pixel art visuals</strong> with <strong>dynamic lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Enjoy a <strong>relaxing</strong> and <strong>peaceful experience</strong> that you can come back to once in a while</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Unleash <strong>your creativity</strong> and watch <strong>your tiny landscape</strong> slowly getting back to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/e172a227b9ec11688abd2ecc582d4f6e.avif?t=1752700129\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT RADIANT SLOTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiant Sloth (he/him) is a <strong>solo indie game developer</strong> from France, He has a passion for creating <strong>inspiring and entertaining art</strong>, and is committed to <strong>ethical and sustainable game development</strong>. In particular, he strives to maintain <strong>honest and transparent communication</strong> with the community, advocates <strong>awareness of carbon footprint</strong> and climate issues, and <strong>bans generative AI tools</strong> from his creation process.</p>",
    "short_description": "My Tiny Landscape is a minimalist colorful landscape builder. Bring procedural archipelagos back to life by placing biomes and regrowing a vibrant landscape tile by tile. Strategize to leverage placement rules and maximize your score, or simply enjoy a relaxing peaceful experience.",
